{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Make Way</i></strong> is classic, top-down, multiplayer racing shifted up multiple gears. It's a party game at heart, inspired by the chaotic racing of\u00a0<i><strong>Mashed </strong></i>and<strong><i> Micro Machines</i></strong>, and the course-building mayhem of <strong><i>Ultimate Chicken Horse</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab track pieces from a pick n mix menu and snap them together to build your first course. Dodge hazards, unleash weaponry, and avoid falling off the edge in a chaotic rush to the finish line, then bolt on new track pieces for the next round.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrap across ever-growing courses with increasingly perilous features until a winner is crowned before starting over with a brand-new course. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/d5af080feaa29a9a46548c339d28f1ed.poster.avif?t=1770241090\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/d5af080feaa29a9a46548c339d28f1ed.webm?t=1770241090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/d5af080feaa29a9a46548c339d28f1ed.mp4?t=1770241090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your course</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together\u2014or against one another\u2014to quickly build tracks using a range of ridiculous pieces, including loops, seesaws, corkscrews, and even train crossings. Then add obstacles and power-ups. Ruin your friends\u2019 race with a well-placed barrier or jettison them off the side of a curve with a crafty boost-pad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/cbd995817d308749b2ad37d88d91d6f3.poster.avif?t=1770241090\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/cbd995817d308749b2ad37d88d91d6f3.webm?t=1770241090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/cbd995817d308749b2ad37d88d91d6f3.mp4?t=1770241090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blow up the competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six racers jostle and shunt to cross checkpoints and reach the finish line. Obliterate opponents with a range of wacky weapons, including goo cannons and Tesla coils, but beware: each checkpoint acts as a respawn point and revenge is a dish best served via a giant mallet or rooftop-mounted shotgun\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep on truckin\u2019</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The finish line isn\u2019t the finish! Add new track pieces after each round to create monstrously large courses, and score bonus points with your performance to take home the trophy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/f67ea058385f6b3e2b10d52500c483c4.poster.avif?t=1770241090\" width=616 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/f67ea058385f6b3e2b10d52500c483c4.webm?t=1770241090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/f67ea058385f6b3e2b10d52500c483c4.mp4?t=1770241090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add to your collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new track pieces and hazards for more dangerous course designs. Add new vehicles to your garage to romp to victory in style. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match unique track pieces and hazards for near-endless course configurations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for weapons and power-ups to gain the advantage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new track pieces and vehicles for wackier races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to six players, on the same screen or online with cross-platform multiplayer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle traps and safety barriers on or off to make those twisty turns easier (or more perilous!) using fully customisable rulesets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make Way's solo developer previously worked on <strong><i>Toybox Turbos</i></strong> and the <strong><i>Micro Machines</i></strong> series.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You Can Drive My Car","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1445790/b6700cc54aab89f062830b588c19348fb66acec9.jpg"},{"name":"Draft That Wheeler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1445790/02b2650c3d9e462dccc3d8365d4f009d3b6cd0aa.jpg"},{"name":"We Have Liftoff","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1445790/2daa3e54faa8a2afc9392dc4a4bf8432abb6623a.jpg"},{"name":"Out of My Way!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1445790/c49b453258f3e76858dfcebe79ce63b6cb410ec3.jpg"},{"name":"Big Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1445790/c94576b24d2d70bb4e6128da7ae554d4087e2199.jpg"},{"name":"Toot One's Own Horn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1445790/d234d2f765